      "settings": {
        "html": "<body>\n\n\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Case Planejamento Estratégico — Hyper Island</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,700;0,800;1,700;1,800&amp;family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,300;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n/* ===== CSS VARIABLES — LIGHT THEME ===== */\n:root {\n  --hi-black: #F5F4F0;        /* page background: warm off-white */\n  --hi-white: #111110;        /* primary text: near-black */\n  --hi-orange: #FF7300;\n  --hi-orange-light: #FF8C00;\n  --hi-gray: #ECEAE4;         /* card/section backgrounds */\n  --hi-gray-mid: #D4D1C8;     /* borders */\n  --hi-gray-light: #888580;   /* muted labels */\n  --hi-gray-pale: #444240;    /* body text */\n  --hi-accent: #2A2927;       /* darker text accent */\n\n  --font-heading: 'Barlow Condensed', 'ABC Gravity', 'Oswald', sans-serif;\n  --font-body: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n  --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n  --spacing-md: 2rem;\n  --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n  --spacing-xl: 8rem;\n}\n\n/* ===== RESET ===== */\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n/* ===== BASE ===== */\nbody {\n  background: var(--hi-black);\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n/* ===== FONT FALLBACK FOR ABC GRAVITY ===== */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'ABC Gravity';\n  src: local('ABC Gravity');\n}\n\nh1, h2, h3, h4, .label {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n}\n\n/* ===== HERO ===== */\n.case-hero {\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n.hero-video-container,\n.hero-image-container {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n.hero-video-container video,\n.hero-image-container img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  opacity: 0.55;\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to bottom,\n    transparent 0%,\n    rgba(10,10,10,0.2) 40%,\n    rgba(10,10,10,0.88) 75%,\n    #0A0A0A 100%\n  );\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n\n.hero-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.case-label {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.case-label::before {\n  content: '';\n  display: block;\n  width: 2rem;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-client-logo {\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.hero-client-logo img {\n  height: 44px;\n  width: auto;\n  opacity: 0.92;\n}\n\n/* Múltiplos logos no hero (cases multicliente) */\n.hero-client-logos {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.hero-client-logos img {\n  height: 32px;\n  width: auto;\n  opacity: 0.92;\n  filter: brightness(0) invert(1);\n}\n\n/* Logo no closing — fundo claro, logo colorida */\n.closing-client-logo {\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.closing-client-logo img {\n  height: 38px;\n  width: auto;\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.closing-client-logos {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.closing-client-logos img {\n  height: 30px;\n  width: auto;\n  opacity: 0.85;\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 6rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  max-width: 900px;\n}\n\n.hero-title em {\n  font-style: italic;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  padding-top: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.hero-meta-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.meta-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n\n.meta-value {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n}\n\n/* ===== SCROLL INDICATOR ===== */\n.scroll-indicator {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: var(--spacing-lg);\n  bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  z-index: 2;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.scroll-indicator span {\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  transform: rotate(180deg);\n}\n\n.scroll-line {\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 60px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--hi-orange), transparent);\n  animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes scrollPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(0.7); }\n  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1); }\n}\n\n/* ===== INTRO SECTION ===== */\n.intro-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.intro-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.25);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n.intro-body p:first-child {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--hi-accent);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  padding-left: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.intro-body p {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n/* ===== STATS BAND ===== */\n.stats-band {\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.stats-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.stat-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.stat-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: #0A0A0A;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.stat-desc {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.65);\n}\n\n/* ===== TIMELINE SECTIONS ===== */\n.timeline-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n.timeline-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);\n  padding-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n}\n\n.timeline-header-client {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.timeline-header-client img {\n  height: 26px;\n  width: auto;\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.timeline-year {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 10rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.85;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.timeline-year.active {\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--hi-orange);\n  color: transparent;\n}\n\n.timeline-header-content {\n  padding-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.timeline-tag {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black);\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.timeline-section-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* ===== CONTENT GRID ===== */\n.content-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.content-grid.two-col {\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n}\n\n.content-grid.text-image {\n  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.content-grid.image-text {\n  grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.content-grid.text-only {\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  max-width: 780px;\n}\n\n.content-text p {\n  font-size: 0.975rem;\n  line-height: 1.85;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.content-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n.content-text strong {\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.content-text h3 {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n/* ===== QUOTE BLOCK ===== */\n.quote-block {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n\n.quote-block::before {\n  content: '\"';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -1rem;\n  right: var(--spacing-md);\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.1;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.quote-text {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  font-style: italic;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n/* ===== MEDIA COMPONENTS ===== */\n.media-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.media-image.portrait {\n  aspect-ratio: 3/4;\n}\n\n.media-image.wide {\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n}\n\n.media-video {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/9;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.media-caption {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n  padding: 0.5rem 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== PHOTO GALLERY ===== */\n.photo-gallery {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-3 {\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-3 .gallery-item {\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-marketing {\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.grid-marketing .gallery-item {\n  aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .photo-gallery.grid-marketing { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n}\n\n/* 2024: large left (2/3) + two stacked right (1/3) */\n.photo-gallery.gallery-2024 {\n  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;\n  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n  height: 480px;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-2024 .gi-tall {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  grid-row: 1 / 3;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-2024 .gi-small {\n  grid-column: 2;\n}\n\n/* 2025: two stacked left (1/3) + large right (2/3) */\n.photo-gallery.gallery-2025 {\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n  height: 480px;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-2025 .gi-small {\n  grid-column: 1;\n}\n\n.photo-gallery.gallery-2025 .gi-tall {\n  grid-column: 2;\n  grid-row: 1 / 3;\n}\n\n.gallery-item {\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.gallery-item img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n}\n\n.gallery-item:hover img {\n  transform: scale(1.04);\n}\n\n/* ===== APPROACH PILLS ===== */\n.approach-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0;\n}\n\n.approach-item {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  align-items: flex-start;\n}\n\n.approach-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 3rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  opacity: 0.4;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 3rem;\n}\n\n.approach-content h4 {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.approach-content p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n/* ===== HIGHLIGHT BOX ===== */\n.highlight-box {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  position: relative;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n\n.highlight-box::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.highlight-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.highlight-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* ===== DIVIDER ===== */\n.section-divider {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.section-divider hr {\n  border: none;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== CLOSING SECTION ===== */\n.closing-section {\n  background: var(--hi-gray);\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.closing-section::before {\n  content: 'HYPER\\AISLAND';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: -2rem;\n  right: -1rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 10rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  white-space: pre;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.closing-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: center;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.closing-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.closing-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.closing-text {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n}\n\n.cta-block {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.cta-block-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black);\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.cta-block p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  color: rgba(10,10,10,0.75);\n}\n\n.cta-button {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: none;\n  align-self: flex-start;\n}\n\n.cta-button:hover { background: #333; }\n\n/* ===== FULL-WIDTH IMAGE BREAK ===== */\n.fullwidth-image {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-height: 600px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== TAGS / SKILL BADGES ===== */\n.skill-badges {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;\n}\n\n.skill-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.skill-badge.orange {\n  border-color: var(--hi-orange);\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  background: rgba(255,115,0,0.06);\n}\n\n/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  :root {\n    --spacing-lg: 2rem;\n    --spacing-xl: 4rem;\n  }\n\n  .intro-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n  .intro-sidebar { position: static; }\n  .intro-number { font-size: 5rem; }\n\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }\n\n  .content-grid.two-col,\n  .content-grid.text-image,\n  .content-grid.image-text { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-2024,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-2025 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; height: 320px; }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n\n  .closing-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .timeline-header { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n  .timeline-year { font-size: clamp(4rem, 15vw, 8rem); }\n\n  .hero-meta { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-2024,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-2025 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; height: auto; }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-2024 .gi-tall,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-2025 .gi-tall { grid-column: 1; grid-row: auto; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-2024 .gi-small,\n  .photo-gallery.gallery-2025 .gi-small { grid-column: 1; aspect-ratio: 4/3; }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .photo-gallery.grid-marketing { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .hero-meta { gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n}\n\n/* ===== ANIMATION ON SCROLL ===== */\n.fade-up {\n  opacity: 0;\n  transform: translateY(30px);\n  transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;\n}\n\n.fade-up.visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(0);\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n<!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"case-hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-image-container\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/OLX_FUTURE_STRATEGY_-_IMG_1548.heic?v=1788207981\" alt=\"Planejamento estratégico Hyper Island\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero-content\">\n    <div class=\"case-label\">Estudo de Caso Multicliente</div>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-client-logos\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/Logo_do_Banco_Bmg_svg.webp?v=1788208418\" alt=\"Banco BMG\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/Nubank_logo_svg.webp?v=1788208417\" alt=\"Nubank\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/olx-104.png?v=1788208418\" alt=\"Grupo OLX\">\n    </div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Planejamento estratégico<br>como prática de <em>liderança<br>coletiva</em>\n</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Clientes</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Banco BMG, Nubank e Grupo OLX</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Período</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">2023 – 2024</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Área</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Planejamento Estratégico &amp; Visão de Futuro</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Formato</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Presencial e Online</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scroll-indicator\">\n    <div class=\"scroll-line\"></div>\n    <span>Scroll</span>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== INTRO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"intro-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"intro-sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"intro-number\">PE</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-label\">Sobre os cases</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-title\">3 empresas.<br>Resultados distintos.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro-body\">\n    <p>Planejamento estratégico é um dos rituais mais importantes — e mais mal executados — da vida corporativa. Quando o processo é conduzido de cima para baixo, o plano existe no papel, mas raramente gera compromisso real em quem precisa executá-lo.</p>\n    <p>A Hyper Island trabalha o planejamento estratégico de outra forma: a partir da premissa de que um plano co-construído pela liderança tem muito mais chances de sair do papel do que um plano recebido pela liderança. Cada jornada começa pela mesma pergunta — como criar as condições para que as pessoas certas pensem juntas, com as ferramentas certas, sobre os desafios reais do negócio?</p>\n    <p>Os três cases a seguir mostram essa abordagem em contextos radicalmente diferentes: uma instituição financeira tradicional vivendo seu primeiro planejamento estratégico coletivo, uma fintech global recuperando a capacidade de pensar no longo prazo, e um grupo de tecnologia transformando incerteza em estratégia acionável.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"skill-badges\">\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Planejamento Estratégico</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Visão Sistêmica</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Cenários de Futuro</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Facilitação</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Banco BMG</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Nubank</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Grupo OLX</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== STATS ==================== -->\n<div class=\"stats-band fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"stats-inner\">\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">3</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Empresas parceiras</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">150+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Líderes e profissionais engajados</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">10+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Ferramentas distintas utilizadas</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ==================== CASE 01: BANCO BMG ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year active\">01</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-header-client\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/Logo_do_Banco_Bmg_svg.webp?v=1788208418\" alt=\"Banco BMG\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Banco BMG · Dezembro 2023</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">O primeiro planejamento<br>estratégico coletivo<br>da história do banco</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid text-image\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>No final de 2023, o Banco BMG vivia um momento de virada. Com a chegada do novo CEO, a organização se preparava para um ciclo ambicioso de crescimento e precisava, pela primeira vez em sua história, reunir toda a liderança em torno de um planejamento estratégico construído de forma coletiva.</p>\n      <p>Durante dois dias presenciais no Hotel Bourbon Atibaia, <strong>60 líderes</strong> das diferentes diretorias do banco foram reunidos em grupos multidisciplinares, cruzando áreas que raramente trabalhavam juntas de forma tão direta.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">01</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Direcionadores 2024 como Ponto de Partida</h4>\n            <p>Os resultados de 2023 e os direcionadores para o próximo ciclo serviram de base comum para que todos os grupos listassem, priorizassem e detalhassem as iniciativas necessárias.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">02</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Banca Avaliadora e Priorização Coletiva</h4>\n            <p>As iniciativas passaram por um processo rigoroso de avaliação em grupo, garantindo que a priorização final refletisse a leitura conjunta da liderança sobre o que realmente importava.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">03</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Metas Compartilhadas entre Diretorias</h4>\n            <p>As diretorias não apenas definiram seus próprios indicadores — se comprometeram com indicadores compartilhados entre áreas, algo raro quando o planejamento é feito de forma isolada.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20231213_142506564.jpg?v=1788208117\" alt=\"Planejamento estratégico Banco BMG\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"media-caption\">Encontro de liderança — Hotel Bourbon Atibaia</div>\n\n      <div class=\"quote-block\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n        <p class=\"quote-text\">O entregável final foi um plano de metas co-criado e alinhado entre todas as diretorias. Mas o resultado mais significativo foi algo mais difícil de medir: os líderes saíram com um nível de energia e senso de propriedade que a organização nunca havia vivenciado antes.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-3\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6936.heic?v=1788208118\" alt=\"Planejamento estratégico Banco BMG\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20231213_191752060.MP.jpg?v=1788208119\" alt=\"Planejamento estratégico Banco BMG\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/PXL_20231212_170100678.MP.jpg?v=1788208119\" alt=\"Planejamento estratégico Banco BMG\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"highlight-box\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">\n    <div class=\"highlight-label\">O resultado</div>\n    <div class=\"highlight-text\">Três facilitadores. Dois dias. Um banco inteiro pensando junto pela primeira vez.</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== CASE 02: GRUPO OLX ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-header-client\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/olx-104.png?v=1788208418\" alt=\"Grupo OLX\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Grupo OLX · Junho 2024</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">Transformando incerteza<br>em estratégia acionável</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid image-text\">\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/OLX_FUTURE_STRATEGY_-_IMG_1545.heic?v=1788207981\" alt=\"Jornada estratégica Grupo OLX\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"media-caption\">Jornada de futuro estratégico — Liderança Grupo OLX</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>Em junho de 2024, o Grupo OLX convidou a Hyper Island para conduzir uma jornada estratégica com sua liderança. O desafio era específico e sofisticado: pensar fora da caixa, superar os vieses que limitam a visão de futuro e transformar incerteza em estratégia acionável.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Cone da Plausibilidade e Forças Motrizes</h4>\n            <p>Mapeamento das forças que estavam moldando o ambiente do negócio e seus níveis de impacto no futuro da companhia.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Wild Cards e Incertezas Críticas</h4>\n            <p>Identificação de eventos de baixa probabilidade e alto impacto que raramente entram nos planejamentos convencionais.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\" style=\"opacity:1; font-size: 1rem; width: auto; padding-top: 0.2rem;\">→</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Cenários em Matriz 2x2</h4>\n            <p>Construção de múltiplos futuros possíveis, cada um narrado como uma história, com implicações e oportunidades priorizadas ao final.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"highlight-box\" style=\"margin-top: 1rem;\">\n        <div class=\"highlight-label\">Resultado</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight-text\">Uma visão de futuro construída pela própria liderança, com ferramentas reutilizáveis nos próximos ciclos.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"photo-gallery grid-3\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem;\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/OLX_FUTURE_STRATEGY_-_IMG_7300.heic?v=1788207981\" alt=\"Jornada estratégica Grupo OLX\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/OLX_FUTURE_STRATEGY_-_IMG_1548.heic?v=1788207981\" alt=\"Jornada estratégica Grupo OLX\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-item\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/OLX_FUTURE_STRATEGY_-_IMG_7289.heic?v=1788207981\" alt=\"Jornada estratégica Grupo OLX\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== CASE 03: NUBANK ==================== -->\n<section class=\"timeline-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"timeline-header\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-year\">03</div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-header-client\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/Nubank_logo_svg.webp?v=1788208417\" alt=\"Nubank\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Nubank · Novembro–Dezembro 2023</div>\n      <h2 class=\"timeline-section-title\">Recuperando a capacidade<br>de pensar no longo prazo</h2>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-grid text-image\">\n    <div class=\"content-text\">\n      <p>O Nubank é uma das fintechs mais valiosas do mundo — uma organização que opera com ritmo de execução intenso, orientado por dados e profundamente focado no presente. Esse foco explica parte do crescimento extraordinário da empresa, mas também tem um custo.</p>\n      <p>Em novembro de 2023, a área de Marketing identificou um problema comum em empresas de alta velocidade: o dia a dia <em>task-driven</em> havia deixado em segundo plano a capacidade de pensar sistemicamente e planejar no médio e longo prazo.</p>\n      <p>A Hyper Island desenhou um programa de <strong>cinco sessões virtuais</strong>, conduzido entre novembro e dezembro de 2023 com cerca de <strong>50 participantes</strong> e quatro facilitadores, em português com tradução simultânea para os participantes de língua espanhola.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"approach-list\">\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">01</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Fundamentos do Pensamento Sistêmico</h4>\n            <p>Princípios como o modelo Iceberg, o Toast e a diversidade cognitiva como base para ampliar a forma como o grupo enxergava os problemas.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">02</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Ferramentas de Visão de Futuro</h4>\n            <p>O cone da plausibilidade, o Futures Wheel e a construção de cenários com a Scenario Matrix.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-item\">\n          <div class=\"approach-number\">03</div>\n          <div class=\"approach-content\">\n            <h4>Cenários Aplicados ao Negócio</h4>\n            <p>Trabalho final com cenários concretos e planos de ação conectados ao contexto real da área de Marketing.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <img class=\"media-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/unnamed_1.png?v=1788208093\" alt=\"Programa Nubank Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"media-caption\">Programa virtual — Time de Marketing Nubank</div>\n\n      <div class=\"quote-block\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n        <p class=\"quote-text\">Os feedbacks foram consistentemente positivos sobre duas dimensões: a qualidade das ferramentas apresentadas e o espaço criado para pensar sobre o futuro de uma forma que o cotidiano raramente permite.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== CLOSING ==================== -->\n<section class=\"closing-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"closing-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"closing-client-logos\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/Logo_do_Banco_Bmg_svg.webp?v=1788208418\" alt=\"Banco BMG\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/Nubank_logo_svg.webp?v=1788208417\" alt=\"Nubank\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/olx-104.png?v=1788208418\" alt=\"Grupo OLX\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"closing-label\">O que esses três cases revelam</div>\n      <h2 class=\"closing-title\">Estratégia é algo<br>que se constrói<br>junto</h2>\n      <p class=\"closing-text\">\n        O Banco BMG precisava construir um planejamento do zero, com comprometimento coletivo, em uma organização que nunca havia feito isso antes. O Nubank precisava recuperar a capacidade de pensar no longo prazo dentro de uma cultura viciada na urgência do curto prazo. O Grupo OLX precisava transformar incerteza em estratégia estruturada e acionável.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"closing-text\" style=\"margin-top:1rem;\">\n        Três necessidades distintas. Três formatos diferentes. E, nos três casos, o mesmo princípio: o planejamento estratégico mais eficaz é aquele que a liderança constrói junto, com as ferramentas certas, em um processo que transforma alinhamento em comprometimento — e comprometimento em execução.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cta-block\">\n      <div class=\"cta-block-title\">Quer construir um planejamento assim com o seu time?</div>\n      <p>Cada organização tem desafios únicos. Nossa abordagem começa pela escuta — sempre.</p>\n      <a href=\"https://www.hyperisland.com.br/pages/contato\" class=\"cta-button\" target=\"_blank\">Fale Conosco</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== SCROLL ANIMATION ==================== -->\n<script>\n(function() {\n  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {\n    entries.forEach(entry => {\n      if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n        entry.target.classList.add('visible');\n      }\n    });\n  }, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: '0px 0px -60px 0px' });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));\n})();\n</script>\n\n\n</body>",
